<view class="page" wx:if="{{session}}"><text class="eyebrow">COACH REPORT</text><view class="title">Your ideas are worth hearing.</view><view class="subtitle">{{session.title}}</view><view class="card"><view class="card-title">Best move</view><view class="quote">{{session.turns[session.turns.length - 1].user}}</view></view><view class="card"><view class="card-title">Next priority</view><view class="card-copy">Explain why your strongest example proves the claim, then compare it with the other side.</view><button class="secondary" bindtap="openLearn">Open recommended lesson</button></view><button class="primary" bindtap="again">Choose another motion</button></view><view wx:else class="empty">Complete a debate to see the coach report.</view>
